<td id="A4.T10.6.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">MaskDiT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib43" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al., 2024</a>)</cite></td>
